   "text": "# Billing and Plans\n\nLanekeep offers three plans:\n\n- **Free** \u2014 up to 3 projects, 2 members per project, community support.\n- **Pro** \u2014 $12/user/month, unlimited projects, priority email support, API access.\n- **Enterprise** \u2014 custom pricing, SSO/SAML, dedicated support, 99.9% uptime SLA.\n\n## Refunds\n\nMonthly subscriptions can be refunded within 14 days of a charge, once per\n12-month period. Annual subscriptions are refundable pro-rata within 30 days.\nRefunds are issued to the original payment method within 5\u201310 business days.\nRefund requests must be handled by a human billing agent \u2014 the support assistant\nshould escalate them.\n\n## Upgrades and downgrades\n\nPlan changes take effect immediately; charges are pro-rated. Downgrading below\nyour current usage (e.g. more than 3 projects on Free) locks the excess projects\nread-only rather than deleting them.\n\nRead-only projects are never deleted and are not subject to a retention clock.\nUpgrading again restores full write access to all of them immediately and\nautomatically.\n",
